to hide\", L\" Â· clic para ocultar\"},\n    {L\" Â· drag to move\", L\" Â· arrastra para mover\"},\n    {L\" Â· hidden, click to show\", L\" Â· oculto, clic para mostrar\"},\n    {L\" Â· main island\", L\" Â· isla principal\"},\n    {L\" Â· no sound\", L\" Â· sin sonido\"},\n    {L\" Â· on the island, Ctrl+drag works too\", L\" Â· en la isla, Ctrl+arrastrar tambiÃ©n funciona\"},\n    {L\" Â· plain color while Windows\u0027 energy saver is on\", L\" Â· color liso mientras el ahorro de baterÃ­a de Windows estÃ¡ activo\"},\n    {L\" Â· plain color: Windows\u0027 transparency effects are off (Personalization \u003e Colors)\", L\" Â· color liso: los efectos de transparencia de Windows estÃ¡n desactivados (PersonalizaciÃ³n \u003e Colores)\"},\n    {L\" Â· press the new keys (Esc cancels)\", L\" Â· pulsa las nuevas teclas (Esc cancela)\"},\n    {L\" Â· this island\", L\" Â· esta isla\"},\n    {L\" Â· whkd isn\u0027t installed (winget install LGUG2Z.whkd)\", L\" Â· whkd no estÃ¡ instalado (winget install LGUG2Z.whkd)\"},\n    {L\"\\\"Following the bell\\\": out of the pill, as now; or at a point of the screen, sliding in from its nearest edge\", L\"\\\"Siguiendo la campana\\\": saliendo de la pÃ­ldora, como ahora; o en un punto de la pantalla, entrando desde el borde mÃ¡s cercano\"},\n    {L\"\\\"Follows the line\\\": as wide as each line; the others keep the widest line\u0027s width. A longer line ends with \\u2026\", L\"Â«Sigue la lÃ­neaÂ»: tan ancha como cada lÃ­nea; las demÃ¡s mantienen el ancho de la mÃ¡s larga. Las lÃ­neas mÃ¡s largas terminan en â€¦\"},\n    {L\"%d items\", L\"%d elementos\"},\n    {L\"%d of %d\", L\"%d de %d\"},\n    {L\"%zu of %zu events\", L\"%zu de %zu eventos\"},\n    {L\"(the wheel turns the pages)\", L\"(la rueda cambia de pÃ¡gina)\"},\n    {L\"+  New event\", L\"+  Nuevo evento\"},\n    {L\"+  New shortcut\", L\"+  Nuevo acceso directo\"},\n    {L\"+ Add alarm\", L\"+ AÃ±adir alarma\"},\n    {L\"+ Line\", L\"+ LÃ­nea\"},\n    {L\"+ saves the