define las opciones principales en pocos pasos, y cada una cambia la isla al instante; todo lo demÃ¡s estÃ¡ en las pestaÃ±as de la izquierda\"},\n    {L\"This computer has no battery\", L\"Este equipo no tiene baterÃ­a\"},\n    {L\"This monitor\u0027s profile: changes here apply to every monitor using it\", L\"Perfil de este monitor: los cambios aquÃ­ valen para todo monitor que lo use\"},\n    {L\"Three\", L\"Tres\"},\n    {L\"Thumbnails of the files\", L\"Miniaturas de los archivos\"},\n    {L\"Thunderstorm\", L\"Tormenta\"},\n    {L\"Thunderstorm with hail\", L\"Tormenta con granizo\"},\n    {L\"Tiling\", L\"Mosaico de ventanas\"},\n    {L\"Time for a break\", L\"Hora del descanso\"},\n    {L\"Time format\", L\"Formato de hora\"},\n    {L\"Time until the next\", L\"Tiempo hasta el prÃ³ximo\"},\n    {L\"Time\u0027s up\", L\"Se acabÃ³ el tiempo\"},\n    {L\"Timer\", L\"Temporizador\"},\n    {L\"Timer on the minimized line\", L\"Temporizador en la lÃ­nea minimizada\"},\n    {L\"Timer, stopwatch and Pomodoro\", L\"Temporizador, cronÃ³metro y Pomodoro\"},\n    {L\"Tips under the icons and buttons (their names, an app\u0027s notifications)\", L\"Consejos bajo los iconos y botones (sus nombres, notificaciones de una app)\"},\n    {L\"Title\", L\"TÃ­tulo\"},\n    {L\"Title width\", L\"Ancho del tÃ­tulo\"},\n    {L\"To talk to me and follow my projects\", L\"Para hablar conmigo y seguir mis proyectos\"},\n    {L\"To use â€œ%sâ€, change:\", L\"Para usar Â«%sÂ», cambia:\"},\n    {L\"Today\", L\"Hoy\"},\n    {L\"Today\u0027s color\", L\"Color de hoy\"},\n    {L\"Tomorrow\", L\"MaÃ±ana\"},\n    {L\"Too many agendas\", L\"Demasiadas agendas\"},\n    {L\"Top\", L\"Arriba\"},\n    {L\"Top left\", L\"Arriba a la izquierda\"},\n    {L\"Top right\", L\"Arriba a la derecha\"},\n    {L\"Topics\", L\"Temas\"},\n    {L\"Total\", L\"Total\"},\n    {L\"Touch keyboard\", L\"Teclado tÃ¡ctil\"},\n    {L\"Transition\", L\"TransiciÃ³n\"},\n    {L\"Translucent glass: a lighter tint and livelier colors\", L\"Cristal translÃºcido: tono mÃ¡s claro y colores mÃ¡s vivos\"},\n    {L\"Tray icons\", L\"Iconos de la bandeja\"},\n    {L\"Turn on Claude Code or Codex in the settings\", L\"Activa Claude Code o Codex en la configuraciÃ³n\"},\n    {L\"Turned off\", L\"Desactivado\"},\n    {L\"Turned on\", L\"Activado\"},\n    {L\"Turns the island\u0027s animations on or off, on every monitor\", L\"Activa o desactiva las animaciones de la isla, en todos los monitores\"},\n    {L\"Type\", L\"Tipo\"},\n    {L\"Type the command line.\", L\"Escribe la lÃ­nea de comando.\"},\n    {L\"Type to filter the shortcutsâ€¦\", L\"Escribe para filtrar los atajosâ€¦\"},\n    {L\"Type what it opens.\", L\"Escribe lo que abre.\"},\n    {L\"Type your note hereâ€¦\", L\"Escribe tu nota aquÃ­â€¦\"},\n    {L\"USB drive\", L\"Unidad USB\"},\n    {L\"USB drive plugged in\", L\"Unidad USB conectada\"},\n    {L\"USB drives\", L\"Unidades USB\"},\n    {L\"USB drives icon on the pill (open or eject them)\", L\"Icono de unidades USB en la pÃ­ldora (abrir o expulsar)\"},\n    {L\"UV index\", L\"Ãndice UV\"},\n    {L\"Ultrawide vertical stack\", L\"Pila vertical ultraancha\"},\n    {L\"Unavailable\", L\"No disponible\"},\n    {L\"Up to 40 favorite files\", L\"Hasta 40 archivos favoritos\"},\n    {L\"Upcoming events\", L\"PrÃ³ximos eventos\"},\n    {L\"Upcoming holidays\", L\"PrÃ³ximos festivos\"},\n    {L\"Update\", L\"Actualizar\"},\n    {L\"Update all\", L\"Actualizar todo\"},\n    {L\"Update ticked\", L\"Actualizar marcados\"},\n    {L\"Updated %lld days ago\", L\"Actualizado hace %lld dÃ­as\"},\n    {L\"Updated %lld h ago\", L\"Actualizado hace %lld h\"},\n    {L\"Updated %lld min ago\", L\"Actualizado hace %lld min\"},\n    {L\"Updated now\", L\"Actualizado ahora\"},\n    {L\"Updates\", L\"Actualizaciones\"},\n    {L\"Updates (winget and Windows Update)\", L\"Actualizaciones (winget y Windows Update)\"},\n    {L\"Upload\", L\"Subida\"},\n    {L\"Upload peak (1 min)\", L\"Pico de subida (1 min)\"},\n    {L\"Upright on the left and right edges\", L\"Vertical en los bordes izquierdo y derecho\"},\n    {L\"Usage\", L\"Uso\"},\n    {L\"Use my location\", L\"Usar mi ubicaciÃ³n\"},\n    {L\"Utilization\", L\"UtilizaciÃ³n\"},\n    {L\"VLC 3 doesn\u0027t tell Windows\u0027 media controls what it plays, so the island can\u0027t see it. With this on, while VLC makes sound, the island reads the song\u0027s name from VLC\u0027s window title, shows it with VLC\u0027s icon, and its buttons press play/pause, previous and next in VLC. No cover or time, and VLC must show the name in its window title (its default)\", L\"VLC 3 no informa a los controles multimedia de Windows de lo que reproduce, asÃ­ que la isla no lo ve. Con esto activado, mientras VLC emite sonido, la isla lee el nombre de la canciÃ³n en el tÃ­tulo de la ventana de VLC, lo muestra con el icono de VLC y sus botones pulsan reproducir/pausa, anterior y siguiente en VLC. Sin carÃ¡tula ni tiempo, y VLC debe mostrar el nombre en el tÃ­tulo de su ventana (es lo habitual)\"},\n    {L\"Vertical stack\", L\"Pila vertical\"},\n    {L\"Vertical stack, main on the right\", L\"Pila vertical, principal a la derecha\"},\n    {L\"Video memory in use (VRAM)\", L\"Memoria de vÃ­deo en uso (VRAM)\"},\n    {L\"Videos\", L\"VÃ­deos\"},\n    {L\"Virtual desktops\", L\"Escritorios virtuales\"},\n    {L\"Virtual desktops (the mouse wheel switches them)\", L\"Escritorios virtuales (la rueda del ratÃ³n los cambia)\"},\n    {L\"Visualizer color\", L\"Color del visualizador\"},\n    {L\"Visualizer color (own)\", L\"Color del visualizador (propio)\"},\n    {L\"Visualizer sensitivity\", L\"Sensibilidad del visualizador\"},\n    {L\"Volume\", L\"Volumen\"},\n    {L\"Volume mixer\", L\"Mezclador de volumen\"},\n    {L\"Volume percentage beside its icon\", L\"Porcentaje de volumen junto al icono\"},\n    {L\"Wallpaper\", L\"Fondo de pantalla\"},\n    {L\"Wallpaper (the wheel: the next one)\", L\"Fondo de pantalla (la rueda: el siguiente)\"},\n    {L\"Wallpaper transition\", L\"TransiciÃ³n del fondo\"},\n    {L\"Wallpapers from a folder (with a transition)\", L\"Fondos de pantalla de una carpeta (con transiciÃ³n)\"},\n    {L\"Weather\", L\"Tiempo\"},\n    {L\"Weather (goes online)\", L\"Tiempo (usa internet)\"},\n    {L\"Weather Icons\", L\"Weather Icons\"},\n    {L\"Weather data by Open-Meteo.com\", L\"Datos del tiempo de Open-Meteo.com\"},\n    {L\"Weather icons\", L\"Iconos del clima\"},\n    {L\"Website\", L\"Sitio web\"},\n    {L\"Week\", L\"Semana\"},\n    {L\"Weekday\", L\"DÃ­a de la semana\"},\n    {L\"Weekdays\", L\"Entre semana\"},\n    {L\"Weekends\", L\"Fines de semana\"},\n    {L\"Welcome to Mac Island \u0026 Dock\", L\"Te damos la bienvenida a Mac Island \u0026 Dock\"},\n    {L\"What Claude Code in a terminal gives its status line (a line in its script, see the item\u0027s panel). The Claude desktop app doesn\u0027t leave its limits on this PC, so it can\u0027t show here\", L\"Lo que Claude Code en una terminal le pasa a su lÃ­nea de estado (una lÃ­nea en su script, mira el panel del elemento). La app de escritorio de Claude no deja sus lÃ­mites en este PC, asÃ­ que no puede aparecer aquÃ­\"},\n    {L\"What Codex writes in its logs on this PC\", L\"Lo que Codex escribe en sus registros en este PC\"},\n    {L\"What it does\", L\"QuÃ© hace\"},\n    {L\"What it opens\", L\"QuÃ© abre\"},\n    {L\"What needs doing?\", L\"Â¿QuÃ© hay que hacer?\"},\n    {L\"What\u0027s new\", L\"Novedades\"},\n    {L\"What\u0027s playing\", L\"Reproduciendo\"},\n    {L\"What\u0027s playing on the minimized line\", L\"Reproduciendo en la lÃ­nea minimizada\"},\n    {L\"What\u0027s playing\u0027s buttons and pictures\", L\"Los botones e imÃ¡genes de lo que suena\"},\n    {L\"When it hides\", L\"CuÃ¡ndo se oculta\"},\n    {L\"Where banners show\", L\"DÃ³nde aparecen los banners\"},\n    {L\"Where the island appears\", L\"DÃ³nde aparece la isla\"},\n    {L\"Where the items go along the bar. Automatic: around the clock when it\u0027s in the middle, otherwise at the right end\", L\"DÃ³nde van los elementos a lo largo de la barra. AutomÃ¡tico: alrededor del reloj cuando estÃ¡ en el medio; si no, en el extremo derecho\"},\n    {L\"While a line is sung, it takes the title and artist\u0027s place; between lines they come back\", L\"Mientras se canta una lÃ­nea, ocupa el lugar del tÃ­tulo y del artista; entre lÃ­neas vuelven\"},\n    {L\"While a timer, Pomodoro or the stopwatch runs, the line becomes a small pill with its ring and its time (with Only the clock, the time goes beside the clock)\", L\"Mientras corre un temporizador, el Pomodoro o el cronÃ³metro, la lÃ­nea se vuelve una pÃ­ldora pequeÃ±a con su anillo y su tiempo (con Â«Solo el reloj al ocultarseÂ», el tiempo va junto al reloj)\"},\n    {L\"While an app\u0027s window is maximized on this monitor, the bar goes back to its usual look (frosted, with the frosted glass on), so the window doesn\u0027t show behind it\", L\"Mientras la ventana de una app estÃ© maximizada en este monitor, la barra vuelve a su aspecto habitual (esmerilada, con el vidrio esmerilado activado), para que la ventana no se vea detrÃ¡s\"},\n    {L\"While something plays, the line becomes a thin pill with the song\u0027s cover and moving bars; the mouse on it opens the island, as on the line (with Only the clock, they go beside the clock)\", L\"Mientras algo suena, la lÃ­nea se convierte en una cÃ¡psula fina con la carÃ¡tula de la canciÃ³n y barras que se mueven; el ratÃ³n sobre ella abre la isla, como en la lÃ­nea (con Solo el reloj, van junto al reloj)\"},\n    {L\"While the app is in front, the pill moves there and shows only the lit icons.\", L\"Mientras la app estÃ¡ delante, la pÃ­ldora se mueve allÃ­ y muestra solo los iconos encendidos.\"},\n    {L\"While the app is in front, the pill moves there and shows only the lit icons. Dragging it then changes its place too.\", L\"Mientras la app estÃ¡ delante, la pÃ­ldora se mueve allÃ­ y muestra solo los iconos encendidos. Arrastrarla tambiÃ©n cambia su posiciÃ³n.\"},\n    {L\"While the timer runs\", L\"Mientras corre el temporizador\"},\n    {L\"Wi-Fi / network\", L\"Wi-Fi / red\"},\n    {L\"Wi-Fi is off\", L\"Wi-Fi desactivado\"},\n    {L\"Wi-Fi, sound, battery, the bell and the clock, each step of them. Click an icon to use a picture of your own for it, its brush (top left) for a color of its own; the x goes back to the pack\u0027s\", L\"Wi-Fi, sonido, baterÃ­a, la campana y el reloj, cada paso de ellos. Haz clic en un icono para usar una imagen tuya en Ã©l, en su pincel (arriba a la izquierda) para un color solo suyo; la x vuelve al del paquete\"},\n    {L\"Wide\", L\"Ancho\"},\n    {L\"Widgets\", L\"Widgets\"},\n    {L\"Width of the edge zone where the mouse brings the pill back\", L\"Ancho de la zona del borde donde el ratÃ³n trae de vuelta la pÃ­ldora\"},\n    {L\"Win+A opens the island\u0027s control center\", L\"Win+A abre el centro de control de la isla\"},\n    {L\"Win+J minimizes the island to its line and brings it back\", L\"Win+J minimiza la isla a su lÃ­nea y la trae de vuelta\"},\n    {L\"Win+L stays Windows\u0027 (it locks the PC)\", L\"Win+L sigue siendo de Windows (bloquea el PC)\"},\n    {L\"Win+N and Win+A can open the island\u0027s notifications and control center instead of Windows\u0027\", L\"Win+N y Win+A pueden abrir las notificaciones y el centro de control de la isla en lugar de los de Windows\"},\n    {L\"Win+N opens the island\u0027s notifications\", L\"Win+N abre las notificaciones de la isla\"},\n    {L\"Win+X menu\", L\"MenÃº Win+X\"},\n    {L\"Wind\", L\"Viento\"},\n    {L\"Window maximized\", L\"Ventana maximizada\"},\n    {L\"Window over it\", L\"Ventana encima\"},\n    {L\"Windows\", L\"Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows 10\", L\"Windows 10\"},\n    {L\"Windows 10\u0027s, where it has them\", L\"Los de Windows 10, donde los tiene\"},\n    {L\"Windows 11\", L\"Windows 11\"},\n    {L\"Windows Settings\", L\"ConfiguraciÃ³n de Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows Update\", L\"Windows Update\"},\n    {L\"Windows accent\", L\"Ã‰nfasis de Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows or another app uses them too, the island takes them first\", L\"Windows u otra app tambiÃ©n las usa; la isla las toma primero\"},\n    {L\"Windows places\", L\"Lugares de Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows shows the networks only to apps allowed to use the location: click to turn on \\\"Let desktop apps access your location\\\"\", L\"Windows muestra las redes solo a apps con acceso a la ubicaciÃ³n: haz clic para activar \\\"Permitir que las aplicaciones de escritorio accedan a tu ubicaciÃ³n\\\"\"},\n    {L\"Windows stopped while a monitor answered a brightness call (DDC/CI). To turn it on again: island settings \u003e Control center \u003e Brightness of external monitors (DDC/CI).\", L\"Windows se detuvo mientras un monitor respondÃ­a al brillo (DDC/CI). Para volver a activarlo: configuraciÃ³n de la isla \u003e Centro de control \u003e Brillo de monitores externos (DDC/CI).\"},\n    {L\"Windows\u0027\", L\"La de Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows\u0027 own icons\", L\"Los iconos del propio Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows\u0027 own: no notification sounds\", L\"La de Windows: sin sonidos de notificaciÃ³n\"},\n    {L\"Windows, Windows 10 and Emoji are Windows\u0027 own fonts. The online ones (all free to use: MIT, Apache 2.0 or ISC) go online once, when chosen: about 150 small SVG pictures are downloaded from cdn.jsdelivr.net (a plain request for each file, nothing about you or your PC is sent), kept in the mod\u0027s folder, and never downloaded again. An icon a pack hasn\u0027t stays Windows\u0027. Your folder: a picture (PNG, SVG, ICO...) per icon, named after it\", L\"Windows, Windows 10 y Emoji son fuentes del propio Windows. Los en lÃ­nea (todos de uso libre: MIT, Apache 2.0 o ISC) usan internet una vez, al elegirlos: se descargan unas 150 imÃ¡genes SVG pequeÃ±as de cdn.jsdelivr.net (una peticiÃ³n simple por archivo, no se envÃ­a nada sobre ti ni tu PC), se guardan en la carpeta del mod y nunca se vuelven a descargar. Un icono que el paquete no tiene sigue siendo el de Windows. Tu carpeta: una imagen (PNG, SVG, ICO...) por icono, con su nombre\"},\n    {L\"With a click\", L\"Con un clic\"},\n    {L\"With a click, the line only grows under the mouse and opens when clicked (the hidden Bar\u0027s clock too)\", L\"Con un clic, la lÃ­nea solo crece bajo el ratÃ³n y se abre al hacer clic (tambiÃ©n el reloj de la Barra oculta)\"},\n    {L\"With its window\u0027s title\", L\"Con el tÃ­tulo de la ventana\"},\n    {L\"With names\", L\"Con nombres\"},\n    {L\"With the Bar style\", L\"Con el estilo Barra\"},\n    {L\"With the Fixed style\", L\"Con el estilo Fija\"},\n    {L\"With the Island style\", L\"Con el estilo Isla\"},\n    {L\"With the island hidden, only this notch\u0027s line shows and opens it\", L\"Con la isla oculta, solo aparece la lÃ­nea de esta muesca, y solo ella la abre\"},\n    {L\"With the line on, a click on the arrow keeps this monitor\u0027s island open until you click it again\", L\"Con la lÃ­nea activada, un clic en la flecha mantiene abierta la isla de este monitor hasta otro clic\"},\n    {L\"With the mouse\", L\"Con el ratÃ³n\"},\n    {L\"Without Git Bash, Claude Code runs its status line in PowerShell: copy the line into its script, after it reads its input into $stdin (see the README)\", L\"Sin Git Bash, Claude Code ejecuta su lÃ­nea de estado en PowerShell: copia la lÃ­nea en su script, despuÃ©s de que lea su entrada en $stdin (mira el README)\"},\n    {L\"Workingâ€¦\", L\"Ejecutandoâ€¦\"},\n    {L\"Workspace\", L\"Espacio de trabajo\"},\n    {L\"World clocks\", L\"Relojes mundiales\"},\n    {L\"World clocks (Windows\u0027 additional clocks)\", L\"Relojes mundiales (relojes adicionales de Windows)\"},\n    {L\"World clocks inside the clock\", L\"Relojes mundiales dentro del reloj\"},\n    {L\"Write\", L\"Escribir\"},\n    {L\"Writes the charge level as a number next to its icon\", L\"Escribe el nive