g dá»¥ng khÃ¡c; Island sáº½ nháº­n tá»• há»£p phÃ­m nÃ y trÆ°á»›c\"},\n    {L\"Windows places\", L\"Lá»‘i táº¯t há»‡ thá»‘ng Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows shows the networks only to apps allowed to use the location: click to turn on \\\"Let desktop apps access your location\\\"\", L\"Windows chá»‰ cho phÃ©p á»©ng dá»¥ng cÃ³ quyá»n vá»‹ trÃ­ truy xuáº¥t danh sÃ¡ch máº¡ng Wi-Fi. Báº¥m Ä‘á»ƒ báº­t â€œCho phÃ©p á»©ng dá»¥ng mÃ¡y tÃ­nh truy cáº­p vá»‹ trÃ­ cá»§a báº¡nâ€\"},\n    {L\"Windows stopped while a monitor answered a brightness call (DDC/CI). To turn it on again: island settings \u003e Control center \u003e Brightness of external monitors (DDC/CI).\", L\"Windows Ä‘Ã£ dá»«ng khi má»™t mÃ n hÃ¬nh Ä‘ang pháº£n há»“i yÃªu cáº§u Ä‘á»™ sÃ¡ng (DDC/CI). Äá»ƒ báº­t láº¡i: cÃ i Ä‘áº·t Island \u003e Trung tÃ¢m Ä‘iá»u khiá»ƒn \u003e Äá»™ sÃ¡ng mÃ n hÃ¬nh ngoÃ i (DDC/CI).\"},\n    {L\"Windows\u0027\", L\"Cá»§a Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows\u0027 own icons\", L\"Biá»ƒu tÆ°á»£ng gá»‘c cá»§a Windows\"},\n    {L\"Windows\u0027 own: no notification sounds\", L\"KhÃ´ng lÃ m phiá»n cá»§a Windows: táº¯t Ã¢m bÃ¡o thÃ´ng bÃ¡o\"},\n    {L\"Windows, Windows 10 and Emoji are Windows\u0027 own fonts. The online ones (all free to use: MIT, Apache 2.0 or ISC) go online once, when chosen: about 150 small SVG pictures are downloaded from cdn.jsdelivr.net (a plain request for each file, nothing about you or your PC is sent), kept in the mod\u0027s folder, and never downloaded again. An icon a pack hasn\u0027t stays Windows\u0027. Your folder: a picture (PNG, SVG, ICO...) per icon, named after it\", L\"Windows, Windows 10 vÃ  Emoji dÃ¹ng phÃ´ng chá»¯ cÃ³ sáºµn cá»§a Windows. CÃ¡c bá»™ trá»±c tuyáº¿n dÃ¹ng giáº¥y phÃ©p MIT, Apache 2.0 hoáº·c ISC. Khi chá»n má»™t bá»™, mod táº£i khoáº£ng 150 tá»‡p SVG nhá» tá»« cdn.jsdelivr.net vÃ  lÆ°u vÃ o thÆ° má»¥c cá»§a mod Ä‘á»ƒ dÃ¹ng láº¡i. Má»—i tá»‡p Ä‘Æ°á»£c táº£i báº±ng má»™t yÃªu cáº§u thÃ´ng thÆ°á»ng, khÃ´ng kÃ¨m thÃ´ng tin cÃ¡ nhÃ¢n hay cáº¥u hÃ¬nh mÃ¡y. Biá»ƒu tÆ°á»£ng cÃ²n thiáº¿u Ä‘Æ°á»£c thay báº±ng biá»ƒu tÆ°á»£ng Windows. Vá»›i â€œThÆ° má»¥c cá»§a báº¡nâ€, Ä‘áº·t má»™t áº£nh PNG, SVG, ICOâ€¦ cho má»—i biá»ƒu tÆ°á»£ng vÃ  Ä‘áº·t tÃªn tá»‡p tÆ°Æ¡ng á»©ng\"},\n    {L\"With a click\", L\"Báº¥m chuá»™t\"},\n    {L\"With a click, the line only grows under the mouse and opens when clicked (the hidden Bar\u0027s clock too)\", L\"Vá»›i lá»±a chá»n â€œBáº¥m chuá»™tâ€, rÃª chuá»™t lÃªn váº¡ch chá»‰ lÃ m váº¡ch lá»›n hÆ¡n; Island chá»‰ má»Ÿ khi báº¥m. Äá»“ng há»“ thu gá»n cá»§a kiá»ƒu Thanh cÅ©ng hoáº¡t Ä‘á»™ng nhÆ° váº­y\"},\n    {L\"With its window\u0027s title\", L\"KÃ¨m tiÃªu Ä‘á» cá»­a sá»•\"},\n    {L\"With names\", L\"Danh sÃ¡ch kÃ¨m tÃªn\"},\n    {L\"With the Bar style\", L\"Vá»›i kiá»ƒu Thanh\"},\n    {L\"With the Fixed style\", L\"Vá»›i kiá»ƒu Cá»‘ Ä‘á»‹nh\"},\n    {L\"With the Island style\", L\"Vá»›i kiá»ƒu Island\"},\n    {L\"With the island hidden, only this notch\u0027s line shows and opens it\", L\"Khi Island áº©n, chá»‰ giá»¯ váº¡ch kÃ­ch hoáº¡t cá»§a Notch nÃ y Ä‘á»ƒ má»Ÿ láº¡i Island\"},\n    {L\"With the line on, a click on the arrow keeps this monitor\u0027s island open until you click it again\", L\"Khi báº­t váº¡ch thu gá»n, báº¥m mÅ©i tÃªn sáº½ giá»¯ Island cá»§a mÃ n hÃ¬nh nÃ y luÃ´n má»Ÿ cho Ä‘áº¿n khi báº¥m láº¡i\"},\n    {L\"With the mouse\", L\"RÃª chuá»™t\"},\n    {L\"Without Git Bash, Claude Code runs its status line in PowerShell: copy the line into its script, after it reads its input into $stdin (see the README)\", L\"Náº¿u khÃ´ng cÃ³ Git Bash, Claude Code cháº¡y thanh tráº¡ng thÃ¡i (status line) báº±ng PowerShell. DÃ¡n dÃ²ng lá»‡nh vÃ o script cá»§a thanh tráº¡ng thÃ¡i, sau Ä‘oáº¡n Ä‘á»c dá»¯ liá»‡u Ä‘áº§u vÃ o vÃ o $stdin (xem README)\"},\n    {L\"Workingâ€¦\", L\"Äang xá»­ lÃ½â€¦\"},\n    {L\"Workspace\", L\"KhÃ´ng gian lÃ m viá»‡c\"},\n    {L\"World clocks\", L\"Äá»“ng há»“ tháº¿ giá»›i\"},\n    {L\"World clocks (Windows\u0027 additional clocks)\", L\"Äá»“ng há»