},\n    {L\"komorebi\u0027s layout\", L\"Bá»‘ cá»¥c komorebi\"},\n    {L\"komorebi: hide the workspaces without windows\", L\"komorebi: áº©n cÃ¡c workspace trá»‘ng khÃ´ng cÃ³ cá»­a sá»•\"},\n    {L\"komorebi: its layout on the pill (a menu changes it)\", L\"komorebi: hiá»‡n tÃªn bá»‘ cá»¥c trÃªn Island (báº¥m Ä‘á»ƒ Ä‘á»•i)\"},\n    {L\"komorebi: with masir (focus follows the mouse)\", L\"komorebi: cháº¡y kÃ¨m masir (chuyá»ƒn tiÃªu Ä‘iá»ƒm theo chuá»™t)\"},\n    {L\"komorebi: with whkd (its shortcuts)\", L\"komorebi: cháº¡y kÃ¨m whkd (phÃ­m táº¯t cá»§a komorebi)\"},\n    {L\"min\", L\"phÃºt\"},\n    {L\"more\", L\"má»¥c ná»¯a\"},\n    {L\"not connected\", L\"chÆ°a káº¿t ná»‘i\"},\n    {L\"notification\", L\"thÃ´ng bÃ¡o\"},\n    {L\"notifications\", L\"thÃ´ng bÃ¡o\"},\n    {L\"now\", L\"vá»«a xong\"},\n    {L\"off\", L\"táº¯t\"},\n    {L\"on\", L\"báº­t\"},\n    {L\"sec\", L\"giÃ¢y\"},\n    {L\"starting now\", L\"báº¯t Ä‘áº§u ngay\"},\n    {L\"tab\", L\"tab\"},\n    {L\"taken by another command\", L\"Ä‘Ã£ Ä‘Æ°á»£c lá»‡nh khÃ¡c dÃ¹ng\"},\n    {L\"taken by another of the island\u0027s shortcuts\", L\"Ä‘Ã£ Ä‘Æ°á»£c phÃ­m táº¯t khÃ¡c cá»§a Island dÃ¹ng\"},\n    {L\"taken by one of your commands\", L\"Ä‘Ã£ Ä‘Æ°á»£c má»™t trong cÃ¡c lá»‡nh cá»§a báº¡n dÃ¹ng\"},\n    {L\"taken by the island\u0027s Win+N or Win+A\", L\"Ä‘Ã£ trÃ¹ng vá»›i phÃ­m táº¯t Win+N hoáº·c Win+A cá»§a Island\"},\n    {L\"this\", L\"má»¥c nÃ y\"},\n    {L\"use Win, Ctrl or Alt with a key\", L\"hÃ£y káº¿t há»£p phÃ­m Win, Ctrl hoáº·c Alt vá»›i má»™t phÃ­m khÃ¡c\"},\n    {L\"week\", L\"tuáº§n\"},\n    {L\"what to change\", L\"xem cÃ¡ch thiáº¿t láº­p\"},\n    {L\"winget couldn\u0027t list them\", L\"winget khÃ´ng láº¥y Ä‘Æ°á»£c danh sÃ¡ch\"},\n    {L\"winget isn\u0027t installed\", L\"mÃ¡y chÆ°a cÃ i winget\"},\n    {L\"yesterday\", L\"hÃ´m qua\"},\n    {L\"â€œRestore what changedâ€ on this option undoes it later\", L\"Chá»n â€œHoÃ n tÃ¡c thay Ä‘á»•iâ€ á»Ÿ tÃ¹y chá»n nÃ y Ä‘á»ƒ khÃ´i phá»¥c cÃ¡c cÃ i Ä‘áº·t vá»«a sá»­a\"},\n    {L\"â€¦and then what else it says it needs\", L\"â€¦vÃ  cÃ¡c Ä‘iá»u kiá»‡n bá»• sung Ä‘Æ°á»£c hiá»ƒn thá»‹ tiáº¿p theo\"},\n    {L\"âœ“ All of them are there\", L\"âœ“ ÄÃ£ Ä‘Ã¡p á»©ng táº¥t cáº£ Ä‘iá»u kiá»‡n\"},\n    {L\"âœ“ Copied\", L\"âœ“ ÄÃ£ sao chÃ©p\"},\n    {L\"\\u2713 Emptied\", L\"âœ“ ÄÃ£ dá»n sáº¡ch\"},\n    {L\"\\u2713 Exported\", L\"âœ“ ÄÃ£ xuáº¥t\"},\n    {L\"âœ“ Saved\", L\"âœ“ ÄÃ£ lÆ°u\"},\n};\n// clang-format on\n\n// The language of the island\u0027s own texts: the one chosen, or like the\n// Windows display language, English unless it\u0027s one of these (Chinese only\n// Simplified; the traditional script reads English).\nenum class TextLanguage {\n    English,\n    Portuguese,\n    Chinese,\n    German,\n    Spanish,\n    Russian,\n    Japanese,\n    Vietnamese\n};\n\n// The one chosen in the island\u0027s settings (islandLanguage, for every\n// island): 0 like Windows, then the languages above in their order (1\n// English, 2 Portuguese, 3 Chinese, 4 German, 5 Spanish, 6 Russian, 7\n// Japanese, 8 Vietnamese).\nint g_textLanguage = 0;\nconstexpr int kTextLanguages = 8;\n\n// What each published version brought (the settings\u0027 \"What\u0027s new\", newest\n// first): a short summary for users, in each of the island\u0027s languages, in\n// TextLanguage\u0027s order. A line starting with \"#\" is a heading, the others\n// are items; an item can start with the option it tells about in braces\n// (see ControlPanel::NoteTarget).\nstruct ReleaseNotes {\n    PCWSTR version;\n    PCWSTR text[kTextLanguages];\n};\nconst ReleaseNotes kReleaseNotes[] = {\n    {L\"3.1.1\",\n     {\n         L\"#Fixes\\n\"\n         L\"The island no longer crashes inside Windows\u0027 media controls while a browser\u0027s videos (like YouTube in Chrome) keep changing, and if the island ever crashes, it starts again by itself.\\n\"\n         L\"With the Fixed style\u0027s notches minimized, a notification\u0027s app icon peeks out only of the notch with the bell, not out of every notch, and no longer for the app you\u0027re using.\\n\"\n         L\"A click on a notification opens its app when the app\u0027s own notification handler doesn\u0027t answer, instead of doing nothing.\\n\"\n         L\"Sleep in the power button\u0027s menu no longer hibernates PCs with Modern Standby: like Start \u003e Sleep, it turns the screen off and lets the PC go to sleep.\\n\"\n         L\"QQ\u0027s and WeChat\u0027s message preview shows again when hovering their icon in the taskbar\u0027s tray with tray icons on the island: the island answers where an icon is only while the mouse is on it there (#7157).\\n\"\n         L\"The settings window takes much less of the processor in its first seconds: the preview\u0027s hint, the \\\"+ Line\\\" glow and the other hints that only fade or pulse draw at most 30 times a second instead of at the monitor\u0027s rate.\\n\"\n         L\"An app\u0027s own counter on its taskbar button (like WhatsApp\u0027s) no longer keeps its icon on the island as a waiting notification while the list is empty: it counts as seen when the app comes to the front or its icon is clicked, and shows again when the number grows.\\n\"\n         L\"Dock: games\u0027 icons (like Steam\u0027s) and other apps without an icon of their own in the Start menu no longer go empty when Windows\u0027 icon cache is out of date, nor show a small icon magnified: the program\u0027s own icon is read as big as the dock shows it (#7207).\\n\"\n         L\"Right after a Windows update, before Microsoft publishes the files Windhawk needs to change the taskbar, the island lost its tray icons: now the taskbar just stays as Windows draws it for those days, and the tray icons and the apps asking for attention keep working; a notice on the island says why.\\n\"\n         L\"The island and its settings no longer freeze for a moment every few seconds when apps are chosen for the visualizer, more so with several monitors or notches: Windows\u0027 list of audio sessions is now read once for all the islands and apps, at most every 1.5 seconds, instead of once per chosen app on each island.\",\n         L\"#CorreÃ§Ãµes\\n\"\n         L\"A ilha nÃ£o cai mais dentro dos controles de mÃ­dia do Windows enquanto os vÃ­deos de um navegador (como o YouTube no Chrome) ficam mudando, e, se um dia ela cair, volta sozinha.\\n\"\n         L\"Com os entalhes do estilo Fixo minimizados, o Ã­cone do app de uma notificaÃ§Ã£o aparece sÃ³ no entalhe do sino, nÃ£o em todos os entalhes, e nÃ£o aparece mais para o app que vocÃª estÃ¡ usando.\\n\"\n         L\"Um clique numa notificaÃ§Ã£o abre o app dela quando o prÃ³prio app nÃ£o responde ao clique da notificaÃ§Ã£o, em vez de nÃ£o fazer nada.\\n\"\n         L\"Suspender no menu do botÃ£o de energia nÃ£o hiberna mais os PCs com Modern Standby: como Iniciar \u003e Suspender, desliga a tela e deixa o PC dormir.\\n\"\n         L\"A prÃ©via de mensagens do QQ e do WeChat volta a aparecer ao passar o mouse no Ã­cone deles na bandeja da barra de tarefas com Ã­cones da bandeja na ilha: a ilha sÃ³ responde onde um Ã­cone estÃ¡ enquanto o mouse estÃ¡ nele ali (#7157).\\n\"\n         L\"A janela de configuraÃ§Ãµes usa bem menos o processador nos primeiros segundos: a dica da prÃ©via, o brilho do \\\"+ Linha\\\" e as outras dicas que sÃ³ esmaecem ou pulsam sÃ£o desenhadas no mÃ¡ximo 30 vezes por segundo, em vez de na taxa do monitor.\\n\"\n         L\"O contador do prÃ³prio app no botÃ£o dele da barra de tarefas (como o do WhatsApp) nÃ£o deixa mais o Ã­cone dele na ilha como uma notificaÃ§Ã£o pendente com a lista vazia: ele conta como visto quando o app vem para a frente ou o Ã­cone Ã© clicado, e volta quando o nÃºmero aumenta.\\n\"\n         L\"Dock: os Ã­cones de jogos (como os da Steam) e de outros apps sem Ã­cone prÃ³prio no menu Iniciar nÃ£o ficam mais vazios quando o cache de Ã­cones do Windows estÃ¡ desatualizado, nem mostram um Ã­cone pequeno ampliado: o Ã­cone do prÃ³prio programa Ã© lido do tamanho que a dock mostra (#7207).\\n\"\n         L\"Logo depois de uma atualizaÃ§Ã£o do Windows, antes de a Microsoft publicar os arquivos que o Windhawk precisa para mexer na barra, a ilha perdia os Ã­cones da bandeja: agora a barra sÃ³ fica como o Windows a desenha nesses dias, e os Ã­cones da bandeja e os apps pedindo atenÃ§Ã£o continuam funcionando; um aviso na ilha explica o motivo.\\n\"\n         L\"A ilha e as configuraÃ§Ãµes nÃ£o travam mais por um instante a cada poucos segundos quando hÃ¡ apps escolhidos para o visualizador, ainda mais com vÃ¡rios monitores ou entalhes: a lista de sessÃµes de Ã¡udio do Windows agora Ã© lida uma vez para todas as ilhas e apps, no mÃ¡ximo a cada 1,5 segundo, em vez de uma vez por app escolhido em cada ilha.\",\n         L\"#ä¿®å¤\\n\"\n         L\"å½“æµè§ˆå™¨ä¸­çš„è§†é¢‘ï¼ˆä¾‹å¦‚ Chrome é‡Œçš„ YouTubeï¼‰ä¸æ–­åˆ‡æ¢æ—¶ï¼ŒçµåŠ¨å²›ä¸å†åœ¨ Windows çš„åª’ä½“æŽ§ä»¶ä¸­å´©æºƒï¼›å³ä½¿çµåŠ¨å²›å´©æºƒï¼Œå®ƒä¹Ÿä¼šè‡ªåŠ¨é‡æ–°å¯åŠ¨ã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"å›ºå®šæ ·å¼çš„åˆ˜æµ·æœ€å°åŒ–æ—¶ï¼Œé€šçŸ¥çš„åº”ç”¨å›¾æ ‡åªä¼šä»Žå¸¦é“ƒé“›çš„åˆ˜æµ·ä¸­æŽ¢å‡ºï¼Œè€Œä¸æ˜¯ä»Žæ¯ä¸ªåˆ˜æµ·ä¸­æŽ¢å‡ºï¼›å¯¹äºŽä½ æ­£åœ¨ä½¿ç”¨çš„åº”ç”¨ï¼Œä¹Ÿä¸å†æŽ¢å‡ºã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"å½“åº”ç”¨è‡ªèº«çš„é€šçŸ¥å¤„ç†ç¨‹åºæ²¡æœ‰å“åº”æ—¶ï¼Œç‚¹å‡»é€šçŸ¥ä¼šæ‰“å¼€è¯¥åº”ç”¨ï¼Œè€Œä¸æ˜¯æ²¡æœ‰ä»»ä½•ååº”ã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"ç”µæºæŒ‰é’®èœå•ä¸­çš„â€œç¡çœ â€ä¸å†è®©æ”¯æŒæ–°å¼å¾…æœºï¼ˆModern Standbyï¼‰çš„ç”µè„‘è¿›å…¥ä¼‘çœ ï¼šä¸Žâ€œå¼€å§‹ \u003e ç¡çœ â€ä¸€æ ·ï¼Œå®ƒä¼šå…³é—­å±å¹•å¹¶è®©ç”µè„‘è¿›å…¥ç¡çœ ã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"åœ¨çµåŠ¨å²›ä¸Šæ˜¾ç¤ºæ‰˜ç›˜å›¾æ ‡æ—¶ï¼Œå°†é¼ æ ‡æ‚¬åœåœ¨ä»»åŠ¡æ æ‰˜ç›˜ä¸­çš„ QQ å’Œå¾®ä¿¡å›¾æ ‡ä¸Šï¼Œåˆèƒ½çœ‹åˆ°å®ƒä»¬çš„æ¶ˆæ¯é¢„è§ˆäº†ï¼šåªæœ‰å½“é¼ æ ‡åœ¨çµåŠ¨å²›ä¸Šçš„å›¾æ ‡ä¸Šæ—¶ï¼ŒçµåŠ¨å²›æ‰ä¼šå›žç­”å›¾æ ‡çš„ä½ç½® (#7157)ã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"è®¾ç½®çª—å£åœ¨æ‰“å¼€åŽçš„å¤´å‡ ç§’å ç”¨çš„å¤„ç†å™¨å¤§å¹…å‡å°‘ï¼šé¢„è§ˆçš„æç¤ºã€â€œ+ åˆ†éš”çº¿â€çš„å…‰æ™•ä»¥åŠå…¶ä»–åªä¼šæ·¡å…¥æ·¡å‡ºæˆ–é—ªçƒçš„æç¤ºï¼Œæ¯ç§’æœ€å¤šç»˜åˆ¶ 30 æ¬¡ï¼Œè€Œä¸æ˜¯æŒ‰æ˜¾ç¤ºå™¨åˆ·æ–°çŽ‡ç»˜åˆ¶ã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"åº”ç”¨åœ¨ä»»åŠ¡æ æŒ‰é’®ä¸Šçš„è®¡æ•°ï¼ˆä¾‹å¦‚ WhatsApp çš„ï¼‰ä¸ä¼šå†åœ¨é€šçŸ¥åˆ—è¡¨ä¸ºç©ºæ—¶ï¼Œè®©å®ƒçš„å›¾æ ‡åƒå¾…å¤„ç†çš„é€šçŸ¥ä¸€æ ·ä¸€ç›´ç•™åœ¨çµåŠ¨å²›ä¸Šï¼šå½“åº”ç”¨åˆ‡æ¢åˆ°å‰å°æˆ–ç‚¹å‡»å…¶å›¾æ ‡æ—¶è§†ä¸ºå·²è¯»ï¼Œæ•°å­—å¢žåŠ æ—¶ä¼šå†æ¬¡æ˜¾ç¤ºã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"ç¨‹åºåžï¼šæ¸¸æˆï¼ˆä¾‹å¦‚ Steam æ¸¸æˆï¼‰ä»¥åŠå…¶ä»–åœ¨å¼€å§‹èœå•ä¸­æ²¡æœ‰è‡ªå·±å›¾æ ‡çš„åº”ç”¨ï¼Œåœ¨ Windows å›¾æ ‡ç¼“å­˜è¿‡æœŸæ—¶ä¸å†æ˜¾ç¤ºä¸ºç©ºç™½ï¼Œä¹Ÿä¸å†æ˜¾ç¤ºè¢«æ”¾å¤§çš„å°å›¾æ ‡ï¼šä¼šæŒ‰ç¨‹åºåžæ˜¾ç¤ºçš„å°ºå¯¸è¯»å–ç¨‹åºè‡ªèº«çš„å›¾æ ‡ (#7207)ã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"Windows æ›´æ–°åŽã€å¾®è½¯å‘å¸ƒ Windhawk ä¿®æ”¹ä»»åŠ¡æ æ‰€éœ€çš„æ–‡ä»¶ä¹‹å‰ï¼ŒçµåŠ¨å²›ä¼šä¸¢å¤±æ‰˜ç›˜å›¾æ ‡ï¼šçŽ°åœ¨è¿™å‡ å¤©ä»»åŠ¡æ åªæ˜¯ä¿æŒ Windows åŽŸæ ·ï¼Œæ‰˜ç›˜å›¾æ ‡å’Œè¯·æ±‚æ³¨æ„çš„åº”ç”¨ç…§å¸¸å·¥ä½œï¼ŒçµåŠ¨å²›ä¸Šä¼šæœ‰é€šçŸ¥è¯´æ˜ŽåŽŸå› ã€‚\\n\"\n         L\"ä¸ºéŸ³é¢‘å¯è§†åŒ–é€‰æ‹©äº†åº”ç”¨æ—¶ï¼ŒçµåŠ¨å²›åŠå…¶è®¾ç½®ä¸å†æ¯éš”å‡ ç§’å¡é¡¿ä¸€ä¸‹ï¼ˆå¤šæ˜¾ç¤ºå™¨æˆ–å¤šä¸ªåˆ˜æµ·æ—¶æ›´æ˜Žæ˜¾ï¼‰ï¼šçŽ°åœ¨ Windows çš„éŸ³é¢‘ä¼šè¯åˆ—è¡¨ä¸ºæ‰€æœ‰çµåŠ¨å²›å’Œåº”ç”¨åªè¯»å–ä¸€æ¬¡ï¼Œæœ€å¤šæ¯ 1.5 ç§’ä¸€æ¬¡ï¼Œè€Œä¸æ˜¯åœ¨æ¯ä¸ªçµåŠ¨å²›ä¸Šä¸ºæ¯ä¸ªæ‰€é€‰åº”ç”¨å„è¯»å–ä¸€æ¬¡ã€‚\",\n         L\"#Korrekturen\\n\"\n         L\"Die Insel stÃ¼rzt nicht mehr in den Mediensteuerelementen von Windows ab, wÃ¤hrend die Videos eines Browsers (wie YouTube in Chrome) stÃ¤ndig wechseln, und falls die Insel doch einmal abstÃ¼rzt, startet sie von selbst neu.\\n\"\n         L\"Sind die Notches des Stils â€žFestâ€œ minimiert, lugt das App-Symbol einer Benachrichtigung nur noch aus der Notch mit der Glocke hervor, nicht mehr aus jeder Notch, und nicht mehr fÃ¼r die App, die du gerade benutzt.\\n\"\n         L\"Ein Klick auf eine Benachrichtigung Ã¶ffnet ihre App, wenn der Benachrichtigungs-Handler der App nicht antwortet, statt nichts zu tun.\\n\"\n         L\"â€žEnergie sparenâ€œ im MenÃ¼ der Ein/Aus-Taste versetzt PCs mit Modern Standby nicht mehr in den Ruhezustand: wie Start \u003e Energie sparen schaltet es den Bildschirm aus und lÃ¤sst den PC schlafen.\\n\"\n         L\"Die Nachrichtenvorschau von QQ und WeChat erscheint wieder, wenn man mit der Maus Ã¼ber ihr Symbol im Infobereich der Taskleiste fÃ¤hrt, wÃ¤hrend Infobereich-Symbole auf der Insel sind: Die Insel nennt die Position eines Symbols nur, solange die Maus dort darauf ist (#7157).\\n\"\n         L\"Das Einstellungsfenster braucht in den ersten Sekunden viel weniger Prozessorleistung: Der Hinweis der Vorschau, das Leuchten von â€ž+ Linieâ€œ und die anderen Hinweise, die nur ein- und ausblenden oder pulsieren, werden hÃ¶chstens 30-mal pro Sekunde gezeichnet statt mit der Bildwiederholrate des Monitors.\\n\"\n         L\"Der eigene ZÃ¤hler einer App auf ihrer Taskleisten-SchaltflÃ¤che (wie der von WhatsApp) lÃ¤sst ihr Symbol nicht mehr als wartende Benachrichtigung auf der Insel, wÃ¤hrend die Liste leer ist: Er gilt als gesehen, wenn die App in den Vordergrund kommt oder ihr Symbol angeklickt wird, und erscheint wieder, wenn die Zahl steigt.\\n\"\n         L\"Dock: Symbole von Spielen (wie denen von Steam) und anderen Apps ohne eigenes Symbol im StartmenÃ¼ bleiben nicht mehr leer, wenn der Symbolcache von Windows veraltet ist, und zeigen kein vergrÃ¶ÃŸertes kleines Symbol mehr: Das eigene Symbol des Programms wird so groÃŸ gelesen, wie das Dock es zeigt (#7207).\\n\"\n         L\"Direkt nach einem Windows-Update, bevor Microsoft die Dateien verÃ¶ffentlicht, die Windhawk zum Ã„ndern der Taskleiste braucht, verlor die Insel ihre Tray-Symbole: Jetzt bleibt die Taskleiste in diesen Tagen einfach, wie Windows sie zeichnet, und Tray-Symbole und Apps, die Aufmerksamkeit wollen, funktionieren weiter; ein Hinweis auf der Insel erklÃ¤rt, warum.\\n\"\n         L\"Die Insel und ihre Einstellungen stocken nicht mehr alle paar Sekunden kurz, wenn Apps fÃ¼r den Visualizer gewÃ¤hlt sind, besonders mit mehreren Monitoren oder Notches: Die Liste der Audiositzungen von Windows wird jetzt einmal fÃ¼r alle Inseln und Apps gelesen, hÃ¶chstens alle 1,5 Sekunden, statt einmal pro gewÃ¤hlter App auf jeder Insel.\",\n         L\"#Correcciones\\n\"\n         L\"La isla ya no se bloquea dentro de los controles multimedia de Windows mientras los vÃ­deos de un navegador (como YouTube en Chrome) cambian una y otra vez, y si alguna vez se bloquea, vuelve a abrirse sola.\\n\"\n         L\"Con las muescas del estilo Fijo minimizadas, el icono de la app de una notificaciÃ³n asoma solo por la muesca de la campana, no por todas, y ya no asoma para la app que estÃ¡s usando.\\n\"\n         L\"Un clic en una notificaciÃ³n abre su app cuando el propio controlador de notificaciones de la app no responde, en lugar de no hacer nada.\\n\"\n         L\"Suspender en el menÃº del botÃ³n de encendido ya no hiberna los PC con Modern Standby: como Inicio \u003e Suspender, apaga la pantalla y deja que el PC se suspenda.\\n\"\n         L\"La vista previa de mensajes de QQ y WeChat vuelve a aparecer al pasar el ratÃ³n por su icono en la bandeja de la barra de tareas con iconos de la bandeja en la isla: la isla solo responde dÃ³nde estÃ¡ un icono mientras el ratÃ³n estÃ¡ sobre Ã©l allÃ­ (#7157).\\n\"\n         L\"La ventana de configuraciÃ³n usa mucho menos el procesador en sus primeros segundos: la pista de la vista previa, el brillo de Â«+ LÃ­neaÂ» y las demÃ¡s pistas que solo se desvanecen o laten se dibujan como mÃ¡ximo 30 veces por segundo en lugar de a la frecuencia del monitor.\\n\"\n         L\"El contador propio de una app en su botÃ³n de la barra de tareas (como el de WhatsApp) ya no deja su icono en la isla como una notificaciÃ³n pendiente con la lista vacÃ­a: cuenta como visto cuando la app pasa al frente o se hace clic en su icono, y vuelve cuando el nÃºmero sube.\\n\"\n         L\"Dock: los iconos de juegos (como los de Steam) y de otras apps sin icono propio en el menÃº Inicio ya no quedan vacÃ­os cuando la cachÃ© de iconos de Windows estÃ¡ desactualizada, ni muestran un icono pequeÃ±o ampliado: el icono del propio programa se lee al tamaÃ±o en que lo muestra el dock (#7207).\\n\"\n         L\"Justo despuÃ©s de una actualizaciÃ³n de Windows, antes de que Microsoft publique los archivos que Windhawk necesita para cambiar la barra, la isla perdÃ­a los iconos de la bandeja: ahora la barra solo queda como Windows la dibuja esos dÃ­as, y los iconos de la bandeja y las apps que piden atenciÃ³n siguen funcionando; un aviso en la isla explica por quÃ©.\\n\"\n         L\"La isla y su configuraciÃ³n ya no se traban un momento cada pocos segundos cuando hay apps elegidas para el visualizador, sobre todo con varios monitores o muescas: la lista de sesiones de audio de Windows ahora se lee una vez para todas las islas y apps, como mucho cada 1,5 segundos, en vez de una vez por app elegida en cada isla.\",\n         L\"#Ð˜ÑÐ¿Ñ€Ð°Ð²Ð»ÐµÐ½Ð¸Ñ\\n\"\n         L\"ÐžÑÑ‚Ñ€Ð¾Ð² Ð±Ð¾Ð»ÑŒÑˆÐµ Ð½Ðµ Ð¿Ð°Ð´Ð°ÐµÑ‚ Ð²Ð½ÑƒÑ‚Ñ€Ð¸ Ð¼ÐµÐ´Ð¸Ð°ÑÐ»ÐµÐ¼ÐµÐ½Ñ‚Ð¾Ð² ÑƒÐ¿Ñ€Ð°Ð²Ð»ÐµÐ½Ð¸Ñ Windows, Ð¿Ð¾ÐºÐ° Ð²Ð¸Ð´ÐµÐ¾ Ð² Ð±Ñ€Ð°ÑƒÐ·ÐµÑ€Ðµ (Ð½Ð°Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ð¼ÐµÑ€, YouTube Ð² Chrome) Ð¿Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ð¾ÑÐ½Ð½Ð¾ Ð¼ÐµÐ½ÑÑŽÑ‚ÑÑ, Ð° ÐµÑÐ»Ð¸ Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ñ€Ð¾Ð² Ð²ÑÑ‘ Ð¶Ðµ ÑƒÐ¿Ð°Ð´Ñ‘Ñ‚, Ð¾Ð½ ÑÐ°Ð¼ Ð·Ð°Ð¿ÑƒÑÑ‚Ð¸Ñ‚ÑÑ ÑÐ½Ð¾Ð²Ð°.\\n\"\n         L\"ÐšÐ¾Ð³Ð´Ð° Ð²Ñ‹Ñ€ÐµÐ·Ñ‹ ÑÑ‚Ð¸Ð»Ñ Â«Ð¤Ð¸ÐºÑÐ¸Ñ€Ð¾Ð²Ð°Ð½Ð½Ñ‹Ð¹Â» ÑÐ²Ñ‘Ñ€Ð½ÑƒÑ‚Ñ‹, Ð·Ð½Ð°Ñ‡Ð¾Ðº Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ð»Ð¾Ð¶ÐµÐ½Ð¸Ñ Ð¸Ð· ÑƒÐ²ÐµÐ´Ð¾Ð¼Ð»ÐµÐ½Ð¸Ñ Ð²Ñ‹Ð³Ð»ÑÐ´Ñ‹Ð²Ð°ÐµÑ‚ Ñ‚Ð¾Ð»ÑŒÐºÐ¾ Ð¸Ð· Ð²Ñ‹Ñ€ÐµÐ·Ð° Ñ ÐºÐ¾Ð»Ð¾ÐºÐ¾Ð»ÑŒÑ‡Ð¸ÐºÐ¾Ð¼, Ð° Ð½Ðµ Ð¸Ð· ÐºÐ°Ð¶Ð´Ð¾Ð³Ð¾ Ð²Ñ‹Ñ€ÐµÐ·Ð°, Ð¸ Ð±Ð¾Ð»ÑŒÑˆÐµ Ð½Ðµ Ð²Ñ‹Ð³Ð»ÑÐ´Ñ‹Ð²Ð°ÐµÑ‚ Ð´Ð»Ñ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ð»Ð¾Ð¶ÐµÐ½Ð¸Ñ, ÐºÐ¾Ñ‚Ð¾Ñ€Ñ‹Ð¼ Ð²Ñ‹ Ð¿Ð¾Ð»ÑŒÐ·ÑƒÐµÑ‚ÐµÑÑŒ.\\n\"\n         L\"Ð©ÐµÐ»Ñ‡Ð¾Ðº Ð¿Ð¾ ÑƒÐ²ÐµÐ´Ð¾Ð¼Ð»ÐµÐ½Ð¸ÑŽ Ð¾Ñ‚ÐºÑ€Ñ‹Ð²Ð°ÐµÑ‚ ÐµÐ³Ð¾ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ð»Ð¾Ð¶ÐµÐ½Ð¸Ðµ, ÐºÐ¾Ð³Ð´Ð° ÑÐ¾Ð±ÑÑ‚Ð²ÐµÐ½Ð½Ñ‹Ð¹ Ð¾Ð±Ñ€Ð°Ð±Ð¾Ñ‚Ñ‡Ð¸Ðº ÑƒÐ²ÐµÐ´Ð¾Ð¼Ð»ÐµÐ½Ð¸Ð¹ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ð»Ð¾Ð¶ÐµÐ½Ð¸Ñ Ð½Ðµ Ð¾Ñ‚Ð²ÐµÑ‡Ð°ÐµÑ‚, Ð²Ð¼ÐµÑÑ‚Ð¾ Ñ‚Ð¾Ð³Ð¾ Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾Ð±Ñ‹ Ð½Ð¸Ñ‡ÐµÐ³Ð¾ Ð½Ðµ Ð´ÐµÐ»Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒ.\\n\"\n         L\"Â«Ð¡Ð¿ÑÑ‰Ð¸Ð¹ Ñ€ÐµÐ¶Ð¸Ð¼Â» Ð² Ð